meta {
  name: Remittance
}

docs {
  Requires `jwt_token` in the environment — run Auth / Login first (after
  Account / Create Account (Sender)). Every request in this folder sends
  `Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}`.

  This folder used to mint its own JWT locally (via a pre-request script,
  since no login endpoint existed yet — see CLAUDE.md's now-fixed history
  on this). Now that POST /login is real, that workaround is gone; this
  folder only reads whatever token Auth / Login last saved.
}
